      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "今、交易相手のブリギットの偉いさんが逗留してて、\n美味い酒と食い物でもてなししてるんだが……\n踊りとなると地方の舞い手じゃ腕前が心配だ。\n帝都で評判の人に御願いしたい。頼んだぞ！",
        "official_en": "I'm hosting my trading partner, an important client\nfrom Brigid. We have the best in food and drink,\nbut...the dancers here aren't exactly world-class.\nIs there one in the capital who can help me?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
