      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大盛り上がりだったな！　ありがとうよ！\n文化の違いってもんがあるから、心配してたんだが\n一流の芸ってのはそういうのを超越してるよな。\nこれからも先方と仲良くできそうだ。感謝だぜ！",
        "official_en": "What a great turnout! Thanks! I was worried the\ncultural differences might get in the way, but I guess\ngreat art transcends such things. With that, I'm\nconfident we'll have a strong business relationship.",
